+/**
+ * \brief Compile and link the temporal denoise pass
+ *
+ * The pass reuses identity.vert: it draws a full screen quad over the
+ * already debayered scene, so it needs no projection of its own.
+ *
+ * \return 0 on success, or a negative error code otherwise
+ */
